# "Treasure grid" — the last project, pulling the guide together: an array
# for the map, a subroutine that draws it, INPUT for the digs, and IF to
# decide. From a freshly booted machine the treasure is at square 9 —
# row 3, column 1.
wait (OK|\?)
send 1\r
send 1\r
send 3\r
send 1\r
expect ^NOTHING THERE$
expect ^TREASURE\. FOUND IN 2 DIGS\.$
